## Why This Is Asked

Tests understanding of page replacement and trace-based fault analysis. It also checks ability to translate a policy into a tiny simulator and reason about edge cases in a beginner OS context.

## Key Concepts

- Page replacement policies (FIFO, CLOCK)
- Counting faults from a reference string
- Clock hand movement and per-frame reference bits

## Code Example

```javascript
// Minimal CLOCK eviction path (pseudo)
function clockVictim(frames, hand){
  while(true){
    if(!frames[hand].ref){
      const victim = hand;
      // evict frames[victim]
      return (victim + 1) % frames.length;
    } else {
      frames[hand].ref = false;
      hand = (hand + 1) % frames.length;
    }
  }
}
```

